-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",94,{
[2977]="7006F2D0\n1\tTalk to Mashdagâl at Gadim-ûn\tMashdagâl has become increasingly agitated by the talk in Gadim-ûn.\n2\tTalk to Ulishár at Gadim-ûn\tUlishár is at Gadim-ûn, and wishes to speak to you.\n3\tTravel to the Crypts of Khâb Daku south-west of Gadim-ûn\tThe Crypts of Khâb Daku are south-west of Gadim-ûn.\n4\tDefeat wights and shades at the Crypts of Khâb Daku ([see journal]/6)\tIt is your duty to face the wights at the Crypts of Khâb Daku, and wherever you find them.\n5\tDefeat wights and shades at the Crypts of Khâb Daku (5/6)\tIt is your duty to face the wights at the Crypts of Khâb Daku, and wherever you find them.\n6\tHurry east to Spoiler's Crag and find the source of the scream\tYou heard the cries of hyenas and a scream to the east, near Spoiler's Crag.\n7\tSearch the body of the slain sorcerer at Spoiler's Crag\tThe slain sorcerer at Spoiler's Crag may have something of interest on his person, as did the other you found.\n8\tRead the mad scratchings of the sorcerer of Ordâkh\tYou picked up another parchment covered in a sorcerer's mad ravings.\n9\tBring the parchment you found to Glorfindel in Gadim-ûn\tGlorfindel will want to see the writings of this sorcerer of Ordâkh as well. The Elf-lord waits for you in Gadim-ûn.\n",
[2978]="7006F2D1\n1\tTalk to the Hamâti soldier Kishâtal in Gadim-ûn\tThe Hamâti soldier Kishâtal in Gadim-ûn has something he wishes to say to you.\n2\tWork with Shenzâmin and complete 'Emissaries to Jiret-menêsh'\030Work with Glorfindel and complete 'The Madness at Damudûr'\030Work with Rahâzi and complete 'A Song of Shurug-nîn'\030Work with Ulishár and complete 'A Difficult Step'\tYour companions within Gadim-ûn have a number of investigations with which they need your help.\n3\tMeet with your companions on the road toward Idagâl\tHaving aided your companions with their investigations, you should now meet them where the road leads toward Idagâl.\n4\tTalk to Glorfindel on the road toward Idagâl\tGlorfindel is on the road toward Idagâl.\n5\tTalk to Rahâzi on the road toward Idagâl\tRahâzi is on the road toward Idagâl.\n",
[2979]="7006F327\n1\tTalk to Ulishár on the road into Idagâl\tUlishár stands by the road into Idagâl.\n2\tTravel to the village of Ahâba by the oasis in Idagâl, and introduce yourself to Malgârzor\tYour next destination is the small village of Ahâba located by the oasis in Idagâl.\n3\tTalk to Malgârzor in Ahâba\tThe herdsman Malgârzor in Ahâba eyes you cautiously.\n4\tDefeat vultures at the Fane of Shahûru (total: 4)\030Defeat Ordâkhai \"vultures\" at the Wither-watch (total: 4)\030Defeat brigand \"vultures\" at Kidu-bâla (total: 4)\tThe herdsman Malgârzor in Ahâba asked you to defeat \"vultures\" of different kinds.\n5\tTalk to Malgârzor in Ahâba\tThe herdsman Malgârzor in Ahâba will be interested to hear that you dealt with the vultures, as well as the \"vultures.\"\n6\tTalk to Rahâzi at Ahâba\tRahâzi is at Ahâba in Idagâl.\n",
[2980]="7006F332\n1\tMeet with Rahâzi by the dragon-bones in the Dry-whelm, west of Ahâba\tRahâzi wants to examine the dragon-bones said to lie within the Dry-whelm, west of Ahâba.\n2\tTalk to Rahâzi by the dragon-bones in the Dry-whelm\tRahâzi stares at the dragon-bones in the Dry-whelm.\n3\tTalk to Glorfindel by the dragon-bones in the Dry-whelm\tGlorfindel is in the Dry-whelm.\n4\tTravel to the feet of the Dawn-warden statue north-west of the Dry-whelm\tGlorfindel is interested in seeing the Dawn-warden statue to the north-west of the Dry-whelm up close.\n5\tTalk to Glorfindel at the Dawn-warden\tGlorfindel is at the Dawn-warden statue in Idagâl.\n6\tTalk to Dimûzga at the Dawn-warden\030Talk to Bâlamar at the Dawn-warden\tA number of wayfarers have made pilgrimages to the Dawn-warden statue in Idagâl.\n7\tTalk to Kindrígi at the Dawn-warden\tA number of wayfarers have made pilgrimages to the Dawn-warden statue in Idagâl.\n8\tDefeat kergrim at the Tombs of Khâb Ishil (total: 6)\030Collect sacred stones from the Tombs of Khâb Ishil (total: 4)\tKindrígi asked you to defeat the creatures at the Tombs of Khâb Ishil and recover the stones they stole from the site of the Dawn-warden.\n9\tBring the sacred stones to Kindrígi at the Dawn-warden\tKindrígi is waiting to hear news of your success, and to accept delivery of the sacred stones the kergrim stole from the Dawn-warden site.\n",
[2981]="7006F333\n1\tTalk to Glorfindel at the Dawn-warden\tGlorfindel is at the Dawn-warden in Idagâl.\n2\tTalk to Rahâzi by the dragon-bones in the Dry-whelm\tRahâzi is by the dragon-bones in the Dry-whelm.\n3\tReturn to the village of Ahâba in Idagâl, and meet your companions on the central island of the oasis\tYour companions agreed to meet back at the village of Ahâba in Idagâl, on the central island in the oasis.\n4\tTalk to Inkanûsh at Ahâba\tInkanûsh has come to Ahâba.\n5\tListen to what Inkanûsh has discovered\tInkanûsh waits at the village of Ahâba, eager to tell you what he has discovered.\n6\tInkanûsh waits at the village of Ahâba, eager to tell you what he has discovered.\t\n7\tListen to what Inkanûsh has discovered\tInkanûsh waits at the village of Ahâba, eager to tell you what he has discovered.\n8\tTalk to Inkanûsh at Ahâba\tInkanûsh is at the village of Ahâba.\n9\tRejoin your companions in north-east Ahâba\tInkanûsh suggested you join your companions at north-east Ahâba.\n10\tTalk to Ulishár in north-east Ahâba\tUlishár is in north-east Ahâba.\n11\tTalk to Satagêra in north-east Ahâba\tSatagêra is in north-east Ahâba.\n",
[2982]="7006F334\n1\tRead the script Satagêra gave to you\tSatagêra gave you part of the script she has already written.\n2\tTalk to Satagêra in north-east Ahâba\tSatagêra is in north-east Ahâba.\n3\tRead another part of the script Satagêra gave to you\tSatagêra gave you another part of the script she has written.\n4\tTalk to Jêsamin in north-east Ahâba\tJêsamin is in north-east Ahâba.\n5\tTalk to Imalêkh in north-east Ahâba\tImalêkh is in north-east Ahâba.\n6\tReturn the pages she gave you to Satagêra in north-east Ahâba\tYou have read portions of Satagêra's script and should return them to her.\n7\tTalk to Ulishár in north-east Ahâba\tUlishár is in north-east Ahâba.\n",
[2983]="7006F396\n1\tScout the approach to Emax Dûl above the cliffside\030Study the defences of Emax Dûl from the low wall by the cliffside\tThe approach to Emax Dûl must be scouted for some weakness in the defences.\n2\tScout the approach to the main entrance to Emax Dûl\030Study the main entrance of Emax Dûl from the low wall atop the hill\tThe approach to the main entrance of Emax Dûl must be scouted for some weakness in the defences.\n3\tTalk to Glorfindel outside Emax Dûl\tGlorfindel has also come to scout the defences of Emax Dûl.\n4\tTalk to Inkanûsh in north-east Ahâba\tGlorfindel fears that fighting your way in to Emax Dûl may be the only option available to you, but Inkanûsh in north-east Ahâba will not like that answer.\n5\tTalk to Mashkânu in north-east Ahâba\tMashkânu in north-east Ahâba has an idea.\n6\tTalk to Zimêlkha in north-east Ahâba\tZimêlkha is in north-east Ahâba.\n7\tTalk to Jêsamin in north-east Ahâba\tJêsamin in north-east Ahâba knows what needs to be done.\n8\tTalk to Ulishár in north-east Ahâba\tUlishár is in north-east Ahâba.\n",
[2984]="7006F397\n1\tTalk to Satagêra in north-east Ahâba\tSatagêra is in north-east Ahâba.\n2\tTalk to Atâlsi outside the western entrance to Ahâba\tAtâlsi is outside the western entrance of Ahâba.\n3\tBring the pass to Shâdugan Gânda, the keeper of the mûmakil, at the Scardelve\tShâdugan Gânda, the keeper of the mûmakil, is at the Scardelve, south of Ahâba.\n4\tPoint at the mûmak you want from the Scardelve\tYou have only known Têrkar's Travellers for a short time, but you are reasonably certain they would want you to point at the largest of the mûmakil.\n5\tTalk to Shâdugan Gânda at the Scardelve\tShâdugan Gânda, the keeper of the mûmakil, is at the Scardelve, south of Ahâba.\n6\tTalk to Satagêra in north-east Ahâba\tSatagêra is in north-east Ahâba.\n7\tRead the new portion of the script Satagêra gave to you\tSatagêra has given you some fresh pages of her script to read.\n8\tReturn the script to Satagêra in north-east Ahâba\tSatagêra is in north-east Ahâba, waiting for your response to her script.\n9\tFind Inkanûsh in south-east Ahâba\tInkanûsh has gone to south-east Ahâba to think about the plan.\n10\tTalk to Inkanûsh in south-east Ahâba\tInkanûsh stands in south-east Ahâba, deep in thought.\n11\tTalk to Mashkânu in south-east Ahâba\tMashkânu is in south-east Ahâba.\n12\tTalk to Ulishár in south-east Ahâba\tUlishár is in south-east Ahâba.\n",
[2985]="7001B77E\n1\tTalk to Ningloril and infiltrate the dungeons of Dol Guldur\tNingloril is in Thangúlhad, the camp of the Golden Host in Gathbúrz. Ningloril is waiting to travel with you to the dungeons of Dol Guldur to rescue Bori from his imprisonment.\n2\tTalk to Ningloril at Thangúlhad\tNingloril is in Thangúlhad, the camp of the Golden Host in Gathbúrz. You have rescued Bori from the dungeons of Dol Guldur and should speak now to Ningloril, who organized the rescue effort.\n3\tTalk to Bori at Nothgar in Thangúlhad\tBori is inside Nothgar, the central tower of Thangúlhad. Bori is waiting to speak to you to thank you for his rescue.\n",
[2986]="700701EF\n1\tTravel north-west to the camp of Khomar Bóha\tThe Ordâkhai camp of Khomar Bóha is to the north-west of the waggon in which you arrived.\n2\tTalk to Onúkho in Khomar Bóha Your Suspicion Level is: LOW\tOnúkho is in the centre of Khomar Bóha. Your Suspicion Level is: LOW.\n3\tExamine the amphorae to the east Your Suspicion Level is: LOW\tYou should see what is being stored in the amphorae located on the eastern side of Khomar Bóha. Your Suspicion Level is: LOW.\n4\tExamine the nearby map of Sûg Nidar Your Suspicion Level is: MEDIUM\tA map just to the north seems promising. Your Suspicion Level is: MEDIUM.\n5\tTalk to Jóla and explain yourself Your Suspicion Level is: HIGH\tJóla has caught you examining the map of Sûg Nidar, and she demands to hear your explanation! Your Suspicion Level is: HIGH.\n6\tReport to the vendor inside the central tent of Khomar Bóha Your Suspicion Level is: HIGH\tYou have no choice but to go inside the central tent of Khomar Bóha. Your Suspicion Level is: HIGH.\n7\tTalk to Habâti in the central tent of Khomar Bóha Your Suspicion Level is: MEDIUM\tThe Temámir Habâti has set up a shop for the Ordâkhai in the central tent of Khomar Bóha. Your Suspicion Level is: MEDIUM.\n8\tWalk calmly out of Khomar Bóha and arouse no further suspicion Your Suspicion Level is: LOW\tYou should walk calmly out of Khomar Bóha without arousing further suspicion. Your Suspicion Level is: LOW.\n9\tTalk to Rahâzi outside the Ordâkhai camp of Khomar Bóha\tRahâzi is outside the Ordâkhai camp of Khomar Bóha.\n",
[2987]="700701F0\n1\tTravel east in the direction of the Orc-encampment of Drushkála\tRahâzi has suggested that you travel east toward the Orc-encampment of Drushkála so that you might learn more.\n2\tTalk to Rahâzi west of Drushkála\tRahâzi stands west of the Orc-encampment of Drushkála and stares at the ships of the Song moored off the shore.\n3\tApproach Drushkála and remain alert for anything out of the ordinary\tRahâzi asked you to descend the slope and approach the Orc-encampment of Drushkála, remaining alert for anything out of the ordinary.\n4\tSearch the Orc for some sign of what killed him\tWhat slew this Orc so near to the entrance of Drushkála?\n5\tDefeat Orcs at Drushkála (total: 10)\tYou should slay Orcs at their encampment of Drushkála and look for signs of your potential ally.\n6\tReturn to the entrance of Drushkála and look for your potential ally\tHaving slain many Orcs at Drushkála, you should return to the entrance of the Orc-encampment and see if you have drawn the attention of your potential ally.\n7\tTalk to Rahâzi near the entrance to Drushkála\tRahâzi stands alongside an unexpected friend near the outer palisade of Drushkála.\n8\tTalk to Corudan near the entrance to Drushkála\tCorudan stands outside the Orc-encampment of Drushkála, a good distance from where last you saw him.\n",
[2988]="700701F1\n1\tTalk to Corudan outside the Haven of Bâkhridar, in Sûg Nidar\tYou have travelled with Corudan to the opposite shore, very near to the Haven of Bâkhridar, an encampment of Heirsworn within Sûg Nidar.\n2\tCorudan asked you to search supply crates within the Haven of Bâkhridar and then meet him and Rahâzi on the other side.\t\n3\tMeet with Rahâzi and Corudan south-east of the Haven of Bâkhridar\tRahâzi and Corudan agreed to meet up with you south-east of the Haven of Bâkhridar.\n4\tTalk to Rahâzi south-east of the Haven of Bâkhridar\tRahâzi stands south-east of the Haven of Bâkhridar.\n5\tTalk to Corudan south-east of the Haven of Bâkhridar\tCorudan stands south-east of the Haven of Bâkhridar.\n",
[2989]="700701F2\n1\tMake your way to the island on which stands the ruins of Kasukhín, and find Sigileth\tSigileth and Cúridwan intended to set up camp on the island that holds the ruins of Kasukhín, but the bridge leading there lies beyond Starkhaven.\n2\tTalk to Sigileth at Fearwater Notch\tSigileth is by the camp-fire at Fearwater Notch, on the island of Kasukhín.\n3\tFind Cúridwan north-east of Fearwater Notch, by the shore of Kasukhín\tCúridwan went to perform an investigation north-east of Fearwater Notch, on the shore of Kasukhín.\n4\tTalk to Cúridwan north-east of Fearwater Notch\tCúridwan stands by the water's edge north-east of Fearwater Notch.\n5\tReturn to Fearwater Notch with news of Cúridwan's potential solution\tYou should return to Fearwater Notch with news of Cúridwan's investigation.\n6\tTalk to Sigileth at Fearwater Notch\tSigileth stands at Fearwater Notch, awaiting news.\n",
[2990]="70070224\n1\tTalk to Corudan at Fearwater Notch and complete 'The Stockpile'\030Talk to Cúridwan at Fearwater Notch and complete 'Evil's Uses'\030Talk to Rahâzi at Fearwater Notch and complete 'Even A Single Sword'\tYour companions at Fearwater Notch on the island of Kasukhín have several objectives you must achieve if you are to prevent the Song of Waves and Wind from endangering Middle-earth.\n2\tTalk to Sigileth at Fearwater Notch\tSigileth is at Fearwater Notch on the island of Kasukhín.\n",
[2991]="70070222\n1\tTalk to Sigileth at Fearwater Notch and go with her to confront the leaders of the Song\tSigileth is waiting for your signal to confront Nakási and Balakhâd atop the island of Kasukhín.\n2\tTalk to Rahâzi on the island of Kasukhín\tRahâzi is atop the island of Kasukhín.\n",
[2992]="7001B5C9\n1\tTalk to Sigileth at Nothgar in Thangúlhad\tSigileth is in Nothgar, the tower located within the camp of Thangúlhad. Bori has remembered something that may be useful: a secret way into Dol Guldur used by Gandalf long ago.\n2\tFind and walk the secret passage into the foundations of Dol Guldur\tThe mysterious secret way into the foundations of Dol Guldur that Gandalf must have used is surely located somewhere in the rocky spire upon which the fortress stands.\n3\tTalk to Ningloril at Thangúlhad\tNingloril is in Thangúlhad. You have discovered the secret way used by Mithrandir to enter Dol Guldur long ago and should report now to Ningloril.\n",
[2993]="70071540\n1\tTalk to King Elessar in the graveyard and learn how he was wounded\tKing Elessar lies in the graveyard, wounded. What happened while you were away?\n2\tPursue Aphadaer to the northern docks of the burning Harlond\tAphadaer ran for the docks, intending to join Balakhâd and be rewarded for the death of King Elessar.\n3\tTalk to Tatháta by the northern docks of the burning Harlond\tTatháta is by the northern docks of the burning Harlond, near the flagship of the Song.\n",
[2994]="70071542\n1\tTalk to Tatháta and go with her to confront Nakási and Balakhâd\tTatháta is by the northern docks in the burning Harlond, not far from the flagship of the Song.\n2\tTalk to Tatháta on the deck of Nakási's flagship, Tumuldo-râba\tTatháta stands on Nakási's flagship, Tumuldo-râba, outside the burning Harlond.\n",
[2995]="70071543\n1\tTalk to Tatháta and consider Nakási's final words\tTatháta stands on the deck of Nakási's flagship, Tumuldo-râba, outside the burning Harlond.\n2\tTalk to Líniel inside the Harlond infirmary\tLíniel is in the infirmary of the Harlond, helping those injured during the attack.\n",
[2996]="70071544\n1\tTalk to King Elessar in the Harlond infirmary\tKing Elessar recovers from his wound in the Harlond infirmary.\n2\tTalk to Ioreth in the Harlond infirmary\030Talk to Queen Arwen in the Harlond infirmary\tQueen Arwen and Ioreth the Healer have come to the Harlond infirmary.\n3\tTalk to King Elessar in the Harlond infirmary\tKing Elessar recovers from his wound in the Harlond infirmary.\n4\tTalk to Jajax in the Harlond infirmary\tJajax is in the Harlond infirmary.\n",
[2997]="7006EE90\n1\tMount your steed and talk to Rahâzi by Kasukhín to undertake the urgent mission\tYou can return to the Fearwater by using the banner at Khanâg Valoyar, in An Shêru. Rahâzi is atop the island of Kasukhín, in the middle of the Fearwater, with an urgent mission for you.\n2\tTalk to Khashig at his guard-post east of Umbar Baharbêl\tKhashig stands at his guard-post east of Umbar Baharbêl.\n",
[2998]="7006EE91\n1\tRide west to Umbar Baharbêl and give your warning to the guardsmen at the White Gate\tYou must hurry to the eastern gate of Umbar Baharbêl and warn the guardsmen there of the approaching danger.\n2\tBeckon the people nearby to heed you\030Pass through the gate and hurry to the court by the nearby pool\tThe guardsman would not listen. You should hurry to the Waterway Market and beckon for the folk by the pool to heed you.\n3\tWill they heed you?\t\n4\tTalk to Tasâdi the Rumourmonger\030Talk to Ushrin the Purchaser\030Talk to Mother Phúrsi\tThe folk near the Waterway Market must be warned of the approaching danger!\n5\tTalk to Guardsman Phârex by the fountain\tPhârex stands at attention, worried by the tidings you have brought to his city.\n6\tTalk to Daxamat by the pool\tDaxamat stands by the fountain, a worried expression upon his face.\n7\tDaxamat and the others run off to warn the folk of the city!\tDaxamat hurries off to warn the folk of the city about the approaching threat.\n8\tFind Jajax at the forum of Bith Gabâr and warn him of the danger\tAccording to his brother, you will find Jajax at the forum of Bith Gabâr.\n9\tTalk to Jajax and go with him to warn the Kindred of the Coins about the approaching danger\tJajax stands at the forum of Bith Gabâr in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.\n10\tTalk to Itûr within the refuge he has offered you\tDaxamat's Refuge is just west of the Waterway Market in Umbar Baharbêl, behind an unassuming door. Itûr has given you a place to shelter until you can learn what happened to your brother and your friend within Dâr Laja.\n",
[2999]="7006EF56\n1\tLeave your belongings in a corner of the left storage room\tItûr offered you a place in the left storage room of the Refuge. He said to open the southern door and then the storage room would be on the left side of the hall.\n2\tTalk to Itûr in the left storage room\tItûr has followed you into the left storage room. He has a worried expression on his face.\n3\tReturn to the entrance of the refuge to speak with the new Temámir arrival\tItûr told you a Temámir dwarf has come to the refuge asking for you.\n4\tTalk to Birûk, the newly-arrived Temámir dwarf\tA Temámir dwarf has come in search of you. But why?\n5\tTalk to Itûr by the entrance to the refuge\tItûr has returned to the entrance of the refuge, and has some information for you and the Temámir Birûk.\n6\tExplore the cellar beyond the southern hallway of the refuge\tItûr told you about a useful feature of the refuge: a cellar beneath a trapdoor at the far end of the south hall.\n7\tTalk to Birûk in the cellar of the refuge\tBirûk nods pleasantly at the boat in the water.\n8\tReturn to the entrance of the refuge and learn the identity of the new arrivals\tHave more people come to the refuge? You should return to the entrance and learn who has arrived and for what purpose.\n9\tTalk to Phêlex in the entrance to the refuge\030Talk to Khâsha in the entrance to the refuge\tTwo residents of the city have come to the refuge. But why?\n10\tTalk to Itûr in the entrance to the refuge\tItûr stands in the entrance to the refuge, assessing the new arrivals.\n11\tWhat would they do if they were here?\tWhat would they do in this situation, if they were here?\n12\tTalk to Itûr in the entrance to the refuge\tItûr stands in the entrance to the refuge, awaiting your answer.\n",
[3000]="7006EF59\n1\tIf you are to lead a rebellion against traitorous powers, you will need to prepare. The room to the right of the refuge's entrance should serve.\t\n2\tIf you are to lead a rebellion against traitorous powers, you will need to prepare. The room to the right of the refuge's entrance should serve.\t\n3\tTalk to Itûr in the planning room\tItûr stands in the planning room to the right of the refuge's entrance.\n4\tTalk to Itûr in the planning room\tItûr wonders what has befallen the prisoners.\n5\tTalk to Nakûr in the entrance to the refuge\tNakûr, another recent arrival, sits in the entrance to the refuge.\n",
[3001]="7006EF5A\n1\tCheck if there are any messages atop the stairs on the left side of the entrance to the refuge\tThe last time Nakûr checked there were no messages, but perhaps now there will be. If so, the shopkeeper Sekét will have slipped them under the door at the top of the stairs on the left side of the entrance to the refuge.\n2\tTalk to Nakûr in the entrance to the refuge\tNakûr will be pleased to see the arrival of these new messages.\n3\tSpread out the papers on the table in the planning room\tYou should spread out the papers on the table in the planning room to the right of the entrance to the refuge.\n4\tTalk to Shêsha in the planning room\tShêsha and her cat Rûmina study the papers in the planning room.\n5\tGo down to the cellar and see if Birûk has returned\tBirûk was due to arrive sometime soon. You should go down to the cellar and see if the Temámir has returned.\n6\tReturn to the entrance of the refuge and learn what has happened\tSomething has happened by the entrance to the refuge. You hear the sound of voices raised in anger!\n7\tCan bloodshed be avoided?\tTwo leaders of the Kindred of the Coins stand ready to fight!\n8\tTalk to Rothog in the entrance to the refuge\tRothog the Storm stares at you carefully.\n9\tTalk to Belondor in the entrance to the refuge\tKinsman Belondor appraises you.\n",
[3002]="7006EF5B\n1\tUse the table in the planning room to address the gathering\tThe time has come for you to use the table and address the gathering in the planning room to the right of the entrance.\n2\tYour gathered allies await their orders in the planning room to the right of the entrance to the refuge.\t\n3\tTalk to Belondor and go with him to rescue the prisoners\tYour gathered allies await their orders in the planning room to the right of the entrance to the refuge.\n4\tTalk to Belondor and stay behind while he goes to rescue the prisoners\tBelondor awaits the word to begin the rescue mission.\n5\tTalk to Tatháta while the Harlond burns\tYou can return to the Harlond in Flames by using the banner east of the Beacon-gate, in Umbar Baharbêl. You have arrived at the Harlond in time of war, the port-city wreathed in flames.\n",
[3003]="700714A6\n1\tMake your way north-west in search of Gondorian defenders\tYou should make your way north-west past the reeds in search of Gondorian defenders.\n2\tTalk to the soldier of Gondor by the south-western edge of the Harlond\tA soldier of Gondor greets you by the southern side of the burning Harlond, desperate hope written on his face.\n3\tFind more defenders north-west of the Harlond, past the graveyard\tDefenders of Gondor fought bravely against the assault of the Song, but were pushed back to a slope north-west of the Harlond, beyond the graveyard.\n4\tTalk to Borndir on the slope north-west of the graveyard outside the Harlond\tBorndir stands on the slope north-west of the burning Harlond, past the graveyard.\n5\tFind King Elessar at the overlook atop the sloping path north-west of the graveyard outside the burning Harlond\tBorndir told you that King Elessar has gathered a number of soldiers on the overlook at the top of the sloping path north-west of the burning Harlond, and prepares to make a counter-attack against the invaders.\n6\tTalk to King Elessar at the overlook north-west of the burning Harlond\tKing Elessar prepares for the counter-attack from the overlook north-west of the burning Harlond.\n",
[3004]="700714A7\n1\tTalk to Aphadaer on the overlook\030Talk to Lornion on the overlook\030Talk to Glindor on the overlook\tKing Elessar has asked you to speak to his attendants on the overlook north-west of the burning Harlond to learn what must be done for the counter-attack to begin.\n2\tRetrieve Gondorian swords dropped on the path to the overlook during the retreat (total: 4)\tGondorian swords were dropped on the sloping path when the soldiers retreated to the overlook north-west of the burning Harlond.\n3\tLeave the weapons you collected in the barrel by the graveyard\030Find the horse Agladal along the main street and send him to safety\030Find the horse Gaeranor along the main street and send him to safety\030Defeat Orcs throughout the burning Harlond (total: 6)\030Defeat Ordâkhai soldiers throughout the burning Harlond (total: 6)\tYou were told to leave the swords you retrieved in a barrel by the graveyard outside the burning Harlond, rescue frightened horses that fled in the direction of the main street, and defeat Orcs and Ordâkhai that threaten the port.\n4\tReturn to the graveyard outside the burning Harlond\tWith the tasks given to you by King Elessar's attendants now completed, you should return to the graveyard outside the burning Harlond and prepare to push back the invaders.\n5\tTalk to Aphadaer at the graveyard\tAphadaer has called you to him at the graveyard outside the burning Harlond.\n6\tTalk to King Elessar at the graveyard\tKing Elessar is at the graveyard outside the burning Harlond, preparing to strike back against the invaders.\n7\tTalk to Belondor at the graveyard\tBelondor is at the graveyard outside the burning Harlond.\n",
[3005]="70071535\n1\tFind Jajax on the eastern side of the burning Harlond, preparing to storm the docks\tJajax is on the eastern side of the port-city, preparing to storm the docks.\n2\tTalk to Jajax and go with him to sabotage the Narghâk weapons of the Song\tJajax is on the eastern side of the port-city, preparing to storm the docks.\n3\tReturn to the graveyard and talk to King Elessar\tThe day is not yet won. You must return to the graveyard outside the burning Harlond and learn what next can be done.\n4\tTalk to Borndir at the graveyard\tTalk to Borndir at the graveyard and learn what happened to the King.\n",
[3006]="7001B5F1\n1\tTalk to Goldagnir at Thangúlhad\tGoldagnir is in Thangúlhad, the outpost of the Golden Host closest to Dol Guldur. Ningloril has told you to speak with Goldagnir, who is organizing the last assault upon the tower.\n2\tComplete Skirmish: The Battle in the Tower\tYou have your own part to play in the skirmish at the tower, the final assault by the Golden Host upon Dol Guldur. This quest involves a Skirmish that can be completed at Solo, Duo, Small Fellowship, Fellowship, or Raid group sizes by using the Skirmish Join Panel. This Skirmish has a minimum level of 60.\n3\tTalk to Goldagnir at Thangúlhad\tGoldagnir is in Thangúlhad, the closest outpost of the Golden Host to Dol Guldur. With a small victory in hand, you should return to Goldagnir.\n",
[3007]="70049416\n1\tFind Legolas in Dor Amarth\tLegolas can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth. You should bring word to Legolas in Dor Amarth of his father's visit to Lothlórien.\n2\tTalk to Haldir\tYou should talk to Haldir at the entrance to the Court of Lothlórien.\n3\tApproach the War Council\tApproach the Council of War in the Court of Lothlórien.\n4\tTalk to Lord Celeborn\030Talk to Lady Galadriel\tHaving arrived at the Council of War, you should talk to the lord and lady of the court first.\n5\tTalk to Thranduil\tHaving spoken to Celeborn and Galadriel, you should talk to King Thranduil as well.\n6\tTalk to Thranduil and experience 'Session: the Battle Under the Trees'.\tHear Thranduil's tale of the events in Mirkwood and Lothlórien.\n7\tTalk to Thranduil\030Talk to Galadriel\tHear what the Council of War has to say after Thranduil's recounting of the Battle Under the Trees.\n8\tTalk to Legolas\tLegolas seems as if he also wishes to talk with you.\n",
[3008]="70047B3E\n1\tTalk to Pippin\tPippin, Merry, and Gandalf stand just within Cirith Gorgor, before the ruined Black Gates of Mordor. You should hear what Pippin has to say.\n2\tTalk to Gandalf\tPippin, Merry, and Gandalf stand just within Cirith Gorgor, before the ruined Black Gates of Mordor. You should hear Gandalf's response.\n3\tTalk to Merry\tPippin, Merry, and Gandalf stand just within Cirith Gorgor, before the ruined Black Gates of Mordor. You should hear Merry's rejoinder.\n4\tTalk to Gandalf\tPippin, Merry, and Gandalf stand just within Cirith Gorgor, before the ruined Black Gates of Mordor. You should hear what Gandalf has to say in return.\n5\tTalk to Merry\tPippin and Merry have returned to Cirith Gorgor, before the ruined Black Gates of Mordor. You should talk to Merry.\n",
})
